.SH NAME
asn1c \(en the ASN.1 Compiler
.SH SYNOPSIS
asn1c [\f[B]\-E\f[R] [\f[B]\-F\f[R]] | \f[B]\-P\f[R] | \f[B]\-R\f[R]]
.PD 0
